@startuml

title Fair Share: capacity goes round the tenants by weight

start
:a slot frees up;
:order the tenants with waiting work by\n(work in flight / weight), lowest first;
:skip a tenant at its cap;
:give the slot to the first tenant left;
:take that tenant's oldest waiting item;
note right
  a tenant with 500 waiting items
  and a tenant with 3 alternate;
  neither waits behind the other
end note
stop
@enduml
